  <prompt>Migrate the Create Invoice wizard: remove applyFieldMappings, send only user-entered values, create through the BFF child-records adapter (already wrapped by withBffChildWrites), pass mappingSource when needed.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer, React 18 / Fluent UI v9 code pages, Dataverse. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>invoiceService.createInvoice has no applyFieldMappings; payload holds only user-entered values; mapped fields appear on first load; owner = team.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-16. invoiceService.ts wraps the data service with withBffChildWrites (~:120), calls applyFieldMappings at ~:254 and creates at ~:270. Host: src/solutions/CreateInvoiceWizard/src/main.tsx (sprk_createinvoicewizard). Invoice Line Items are out of scope.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/invoiceService.ts (applyFieldMappings ~:254 REMOVED; create ~:270)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/CreateInvoiceWizard.tsx (createRecord ~:170 wiring)</file>
      <file role="new">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/__tests__/invoiceService.payload.test.ts (payload = user-entered values only)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/__tests__/invoiceService.resolver.test.ts (adjust only if it asserts the mapping call)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/CreateInvoiceWizard/src/main.tsx (host; only if it constructs the data service)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateMatterWizard/matterService.ts (reference migration (task 021))</file>
